{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shopping Nightmares is a top-down survival horror game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off enemies using a variety of weapons and survive using different items that you will find as you explore each floor of <strong>The Negative</strong>. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/f64302b890d978bfcd28863d583205f5.poster.avif?t=1773170672\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/f64302b890d978bfcd28863d583205f5.webm?t=1773170672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/f64302b890d978bfcd28863d583205f5.mp4?t=1773170672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flashlight to guide yourself, and use your weapons to fend off different entities that may try to attack you. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/a8bbf35b499970fef11c2ebf0299261e.poster.avif?t=1773170672\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/a8bbf35b499970fef11c2ebf0299261e.webm?t=1773170672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/a8bbf35b499970fef11c2ebf0299261e.mp4?t=1773170672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory using your cursor, and use items whenever you need, make sure to be picky though, you only have <strong>6 slots</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/0e7c3ce6abeb4a2b071488ac16a1e9a8.poster.avif?t=1773170672\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/0e7c3ce6abeb4a2b071488ac16a1e9a8.webm?t=1773170672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/extras/0e7c3ce6abeb4a2b071488ac16a1e9a8.mp4?t=1773170672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't run out of HP</strong> or you'll be begging for the pain to stop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075020?t=1773170672","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075020?t=1773170672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/06a089478a2a4fc725a3ef76914aa2b9f77acc31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773170672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075020/06a089478a2a4fc725a3ef76914aa2b9f77acc31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773170672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of explicit Violence, Gore, Suicide, use of Tobacco and General Mature Content."},"demos":[{"appid":4127890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shopping Nightmares is a top-down survival horror game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off enemies using a variety of weapons and survive using different items that you will find as you explore each floor of <strong>The Negative</strong>. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com